{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28239","headline":"过马嵬山 · 李远","name":"过马嵬山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金甲云旗尽日回，仓皇罗袖满尘埃。\n浓香犹自飘銮辂，恨魄无因离马嵬。\n南内宫人悲帐殿，东溟方士问蓬莱。\n唯余坡上弯环月，时送残蛾入帝台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}